  description: '3 WATER monsters

    This card''s name becomes "Umi" while in the
    Monster Zone. You can only use each of the following effects of "Levia-Dragoon
    - Daedalus" once per turn. If this card is Link Summoned: You can Special Summon
    1 monster that mentions "Atlantis, City of the Sea Dragon" from your Deck. During
    the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send 1 face-up "Umi" you control to the
    GY; discard your opponent''s entire hand, and if you do, they draw the same number
    of cards. Neither player can activate cards or effects in response to this effect''s
    activation.'
